    "title": "Garaway volleyball sweeps triangular with wins over TCC, Waynedale - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dave Mast ,\n13 hours ago The Garaway volleyball team picked up wins over Tuscarawas Central Catholic (25-16, 25-21) and Waynedale (25-19, 25-27, 25-11) during a triangular Aug. 22. Stat leaders for both matches were Audrey Miller (24 kills, 13 digs, three aces), Charlee Yoder (46 assists), Quinn Schwartz (12 kills, five aces, three blocks), True Tango (20 digs, 10 kills), Aubree Jenkins (three aces) and Sami Garber (seven kills). Read full article",
